  triage:title "ProjectCommand failure modes untested at .NET boundary" ;
  triage:description "ProjectCommandTests cover stdout_json_is_sample_tree, output_flag_writes_file, and missing_csproj_exits_2. Missing: build failure (dotnet build exits non-zero), run failure (dotnet run exits non-zero), empty stdout after run, invalid JSON in stdout, run timeout during test execution. The d.6 acceptance criteria name only three test cases; failure modes at the .NET/subprocess boundary are not systematically tested." ;
